title: hangar_routes
---
<<declare $has_key = false>>
<<declare $can_walk = true>>
<<declare $need = 2>>
<<declare $route = "none">>
Navigator: 选一条路。 #line:route_prompt #context:route_choice
-> Navigator: 用 {$need} 根保险丝打开舱门。 <<if $has_key>> #line:route_hatch #context:locked_route
    <<set $route = "hatch">>
    Mechanic: 舱门路线已选。 #line:route_hatch_result #context:route_result
-> Navigator: 走维修楼梯。 <<if $can_walk>> #line:route_stairs #context:open_route
    <<set $route = "stairs">>
    Mechanic: 楼梯路线已选。 #line:route_stairs_result #context:route_result
Navigator: 路线选择结束。 #line:route_end #context:after_choice
===
